  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Polar bear populations in Viscount Melville Sound (Nunavut) may be vulnerable to climate change, impacting community-level decisions related to sustainable harvest and therefore, community vulnerability to climate change. The purpose of this multi-year project was to access the impacts of climate change on the Viscount Melville Sound polar bear population."
